onse-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_verbosity/test/508", "source": "helpsteer2_verbosity", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"if the crypto nft collection project is based on Japansese ninja warriors then can you suggest some rarity level terminalogies\\n\", \"response\": \"Sure, here are some rarity level terminologies that you could use for a crypto NFT collection project based on Japanese ninja warriors:\\n\\n1. Novice: The most common and basic level of ninja warriors, these are the newcomers to the ninja world.\\n2. Apprentice: A level up from Novice, these ninja warriors have started their training and are developing their skills.\\n3. Skilled: These ninja warriors have honed their skills and are considered proficient in their techniques.\\n4. Elite: A rare and exclusive group of ninja warriors who have mastered their craft and are known for their exceptional abilities.\\n5. Legendary: The rarest and most sought-after level of ninja warriors, these are the stuff of legends and have achieved mythical status in the ninja world.\\n6. Master: The highest level of achievement, these ninja warriors have not only mastered their own skills but have also trained and mentored others to become skilled in the ways of the ninja.\\n7. Shadow: A mysterious and elusive level of ninja warriors, these are the spies and assassins who operate in the shadows and are known for their ability to strike unseen and vanish without a trace.\\n8. Samurai: A special class of warrior, these are the noble and honorable warriors who serve as protectors of the realm and are bound by a strict code of honor and conduct.\\n9. Shogun: The military dictator of Japan, these are the ultimate leaders of the ninja world, with unmatched power and authority.\\n10. Kami: A divine or supernatural being, these are the rarest and most powerful of all ninja warriors, with abilities that border on the mystical and otherworldly.\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How long is `response` relative to what `prompt` asked for?\", \"criteria\": [\"Succinct: short, to the point, and the most concise it can be; no additional information beyond what was requested.\", \"Pretty short: on the shorter side, but could still have words, details or text removed before it is at the bare minimum.\", \"Average length: not especially long or short given what the prompt asks; adequate for a full response, neither wordy nor particularly concise.\", \"Moderately long: on the longer side, but could still have more added before it is fully detailed or rambling.\", \"Verbose: particularly lengthy, wordy and/or extensive with extra details given what the prompt requested, whether from repetition or from rich detail.\"]}", "label": "3", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_verbosity/test/188", "source": "helpsteer2_verbosity", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"what are the main needs in earthquake disaster areas\\n<extra_id_1>Assistant\\nThere are several different types of needs in these areas, including:\\n \\n\\n -Physical needs, such as food, water, shelter, and medical care\\n \\n\\n -Psychological needs, such as relief from stress and anxiety\\n \\n\\n -Sociological needs, such as community support and reunification with family and friends\\n<extra_id_1>User\\nwhat are the sociological demands in eartquake disaster areas\\n<extra_id_1>Assistant\\nAfter a disaster, many people feel a sense of loss and a need to connect with others, and often this takes the form of community support and reunification with family and friends. Because these are the main needs, communities often set up reunification centers to support these needs.\\n<extra_id_1>User\\nwhat kind of reunification areas are needed\\n<extra_id_1>Assistant\\nReunification centers are needed to help individuals and families connect with each other and to support the psychological needs of disaster survivors. These centers should be designed with large gathering spaces and include information about missing persons, medical services, and other important resources.\\n<extra_id_1>User\\ncan you suggest the spaces needed?\\n<extra_id_1>Assistant\\nReunification centers should be large enough to accommodate a large number of people, and be easily accessible to the community. These centers can be built using portable structures that can be moved and reconfigured to best meet the needs of the community.\\n<extra_id_1>User\\nWhat kind of places can be build in an extreme disaster areas\\n<extra_id_1>Assistant\\nIn extreme disaster areas, temporary structures can be used to create emergency shelters. These shelters can be designed using materials that can withstand harsh weather conditions. Common examples of these types of structures are:\\n \\n\\n - Canvas tents\\n - Cardboard shelters\\n - Shelters made from discarded wooden pallets\\n - Plywood shelters\\n<extra_id_1>User\\ncan you give more examples\\n<extra_id_1>Assistant\\nYes, here are some more examples of temporary shelters that can be built in extreme disaster areas:\\n \\n\\n - Temporary huts made of wooden boards and plastic sheeting\\n - Camps built from metal sheets\\n - Shelters built from large plastic barrels\\n<extra_id_1>User\\nany additions?\\n<extra_id_1>Assistant\\nYes, I have some additional ideas about temporary shelters that can be used in extreme disaster areas. Some of these examples are:\\n \\n\\n - Barrier shelters made from wooden planks\\n - Temporary shelters made from rebar and plastic sheeting\\n - Huts made from rocks and plastic sheets\\n<extra_id_1>User\\nmore examples?\", \"response\": \"Sure, here are some more examples of temporary shelters that can be built in extreme disaster areas:\\n \\n\\n - Shelters made from tires and wooden planks\\n - Shelters made from bamboo and plastic sheeting\\n - Shelters made from large pieces of cloth and wooden poles\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How long is `response` relative to what `prompt` asked for?\", \"criteria\": [\"Succinct: short, to the point, and the most concise it can be; no additional information beyond what was requested.\", \"Pretty short: on the shorter side, but could still have words, details or text removed before it is at the bare minimum.\", \"Average length: not especially long or short given what the prompt asks; adequate for a full response, neither wordy nor particularly concise.\", \"Moderately long: on the longer side, but could still have more added before it is fully detailed or rambling.\", \"Verbose: particularly lengthy, wordy and/or extensive with extra details given what the prompt requested, whether from repetition or from rich detail.\"]}", "label": "0", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_verbosity/test/490", "source": "helpsteer2_verbosity", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"brainstorm 50 creative ideas with high originality on how to reach out to celebrities or famous influencers with big followings when oneself has no following or very little following\", \"response\": \"1. Create a unique piece of art inspired by the celebrity and share it on social media, tagging them.\\n2. Write a heartfelt letter to the celebrity expressing how they have impacted your life and send it to their publicist or agency.\\n3. Attend their public events or meet-and-greets and create a memorable moment or impression.\\n4. Collaborate with other fans to create a group project or petition to get the celebrity's attention.\\n5. Create a podcast or YouTube channel dedicated to discussing the celebrity's work and invite other fans to contribute.\\n6. Use social media to share positive stories or news about the celebrity to help boost their reputation.\\n7. Offer to volunteer your time or skills to the celebrity's charity or cause.\\n8. Create a social media challenge or hashtag related to the celebrity and encourage others to participate.\\n9. Write a song or rap about the celebrity and share it on social media.\\n10. Use humor to create a funny meme or video that features the celebrity.\\n11. Offer to write a guest blog post or article about the celebrity for a popular website or publication.\\n12. Attend a conference or industry event where the celebrity will be speaking and ask a thoughtful question during the Q&A.\\n13. Create a detailed infographic or visual representation of the celebrity's achievements or impact.\\n14. Write a fictional story or script that features the celebrity as a character and share it online.\\n15. Use social media to live-tweet or comment on the celebrity's projects or appearances in real-time.\\n16. Offer to translate the celebrity's social media posts or website content into another language.\\n17. Create a virtual tribute or fan site dedicated to the celebrity and share it with other fans.\\n18. Participate in online fan communities or forums and share your knowledge and passion for the celebrity.\\n19. Use social media to share behind-the-scenes content or trivia about the celebrity's work.\\n20. Attend a fan convention or festival where the celebrity will be appearing and create a unique costume or prop to stand out.\\n21. Write a book or create a documentary about the celebrity's life and career.\\n22. Use social media to share positive reviews or testimonials about the celebrity's work.\\n23. Create a poll or survey about the celebrity's work and share the results with them.\\n24. Use social media to share fan art or other creative works inspired by the celebrity.\\n25. Offer to help promote the celebrity's projects or causes on your own social media channels.\\n26. Use social media to share inspirational quotes or messages from the celebrity.\\n27. Create a video or podcast series that explores the celebrity's impact on popular culture.\\n28. Use social media to share your own personal stories or experiences related to the celebrity.\\n29. Create a virtual reality experience or game that features the celebrity as a character.\\n30. Use social media to share trivia or interesting facts about the celebrity.\\n31. Create a parody or tribute video that showcases the celebrity's work.\\n32. Use social media to share positive news stories or articles about the celebrity.\\n33. Create a series of memes or GIFs that feature the celebrity and share them on social media.\\n34. Use social media to share your own personal reviews or critiques of the celebrity's work.\\n35. Create a podcast or YouTube series that explores the celebrity's life and career.\\n36. Use social media to share your own personal thoughts or reflections on the celebrity's work.\\n37. Create a virtual choir or musical performance that features the celebrity's music.\\n38. Use social media to share your own personal stories or experiences related to the celebrity's work.\\n39. Create a virtual scrapbook or collage that showcases the celebrity's career.\\n40. Use social media to share your own personal thoughts or reflections on the celebrity's impact.\\n41. Create a virtual museum or exhibit that showcases the celebrity's achievements.\\n42. Use social media to share your own personal reviews or critiques of the celebrity's work.\\n43. Create a virtual quiz or trivia game that tests fans' knowledge of the celebrity.\\n44. Use social media to share your own personal stories or experiences related\\n45. to the celebrity's philanthropy or activism.\\n46. Create a virtual art gallery or exhibit that showcases the celebrity's influence on art and culture.\\n47. Use social media to share your own personal thoughts or reflections on the celebrity's legacy.\\n48. Create a virtual concert or performance that features the celebrity's music.\\n49. Use social media to share your own personal stories or experiences related to the celebrity's impact on your life.\\n50. Create a virtual time capsule or archive that preserves the celebrity's work and legacy.\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How long is `response` relative to what `prompt` asked for?\", \"criteria\": [\"Succinct: short, to the point, and the most concise it can be; no additional information beyond what was requested.\", \"Pretty short: on the shorter side, but could still have words, details or text removed before it is at the bare minimum.\", \"Average length: not especially long or short given what the prompt asks; adequate for a full response, neither wordy nor particularly concise.\", \"Moderately long: on the longer side, but could still have more added before it is fully detailed or rambling.\", \"Verbose: particularly lengthy, wordy and/or extensive with extra details given what the prompt requested, whether from repetition or from rich detail.\"]}", "label": "2", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_verbosity/test/173", "source": "helpsteer2_verbosity", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"When a software architect says they're focusing on the risky bits first, what does that mean? I asked them a question about how we would do something, and they replied \\\"we could do it any number of ways, it's not a risk\\\". What does that mean? Why didn't they answer my question?\\n\\n\", \"response\": \"When a software architect says they're focusing on the risky bits first, they mean that they are prioritizing the parts of the project that are most likely to cause problems or delays if not done correctly. This could include tasks such as developing a new feature that has never been done before, implementing a complex algorithm, or working with a new technology that is not well understood. By focusing on these risky bits first, the architect is trying to mitigate the risk of the project failing or being delayed by addressing the most challenging parts upfront.\\n\\nRegarding the reply that \\\"we could do it any number of ways, it's not a risk,\\\" it means that the software architect does not see the task as being particularly risky or challenging. They may be trying to convey that they have confidence in their ability to complete the task and that there are multiple ways to accomplish it, so they are not overly concerned about choosing a specific approach.\\n\\nIt's possible that the software architect did not answer your question directly because they wanted to convey the bigger picture perspective of how they are approaching the project, rather than getting into the specifics of a single task. They may have felt that the overall approach to the project was more important than the details of a single implementation decision.\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How long is `response` relative to what `prompt` asked for?\", \"criteria\": [\"Succinct: short, to the point, and the most concise it can be; no additional information beyond what was requested.\", \"Pretty short: on the shorter side, but could still have words, details or text removed before it is at the bare minimum.\", \"Average length: not especially long or short given what the prompt asks; adequate for a full response, neither wordy nor particularly concise.\", \"Moderately long: on the longer side, but could still have more added before it is fully detailed or rambling.\", \"Verbose: particularly lengthy, wordy and/or extensive with extra details given what the prompt requested, whether from repetition or from rich detail.\"]}", "label": "2", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_verbosity/test/799", "source": "helpsteer2_verbosity", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"What are some unique things about the 37th largest city in Japan? Does it have anything in common with the 76th largest city in China?\", \"response\": \"The 37th largest city in Japan by population is Nagoya, which has a population of approximately 2.3 million people. Nagoya is known for several unique features:\\n\\n* It is a major industrial city and is home to many large corporations, including Toyota, Honda, and Mitsubishi Motors.\\n* Nagoya Castle is one of the most popular tourist destinations in the city, and is known for its elegant design and beautiful gardens.\\n* The city is also famous for its unique cuisine, including dishes like miso katsu (tonkatsu with miso sauce) and hitsumabushi (grilled eel on rice).\\n\\nThe 76th largest city in China by population is Ningbo, which has a population of approximately 7.6 million people. Ningbo shares some similarities with Nagoya in that it is also a major port city and is known for its industry and trade.\\n\\n* Ningbo is one of the busiest ports in China, and is a major hub for the export of goods to other parts of the world.\\n* The city is also known for its long history and cultural heritage, with many historic sites and landmarks.\\n* Ningbo cuisine is also well known, particularly for its seafood dishes and the use of bamboo shoots in cooking.\\n\\nOne unique thing that these two cities share is their status as major transportation and industrial hubs, with well-developed port facilities and strong connections to global trade networks. Additionally, both cities are known for their distinctive local cuisines, and are popular tourist destinations in their respective countries.\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How long is `response` relative to what `prompt` asked for?\", \"criteria\": [\"Succinct: short, to the point, and the most concise it can be; no additional information beyond what was requested.\", \"Pretty short: on the shorter side, but could still have words, details or text removed before it is at the bare minimum.\", \"Average length: not especially long or short given what the prompt asks; adequate for a full response, neither wordy nor particularly concise.\", \"Moderately long: on the longer side, but could still have more added before it is fully detailed or rambling.\", \"Verbose: particularly lengthy, wordy and/or extensive with extra details given what the prompt requested, whether from repetition or from rich detail.\"]}", "label": "2", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_verbosity/test/915", "source": "helpsteer2_verbosity", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"[Partner Cooperation Team] Share webinar schedule for Cafe24 employees\\n hello. This is a partnership team.\\n To have time to share information about 'partner service/market' necessary for customer consulting\\n I was planning a webinar for internal employees.\\n Date: February 9th (Thursday) 3pm\\n Target: Enterprise (customer contact department)\\n Content: 100% utilization, Cafe24 partner service\\n Entering the global market using Market Plus\\n 1. Introduction of Market Plus\\n 2. Introduction to global markets - Joom (entry into European market) / MSS (entry into Japanese market)\\n Pre-Q&A reception: https://forms.gle/mpJZGdii9HQoucic8\\n Please check the webinar access link in the reminder notice next week.\\n \\n\\n A webinar for cafe24 employees will be held with the above contents. Using this content, we plan to create content for an in-house blog site that helps Cafe24 employees understand how to enter the global market using Market Plus. Please write a detailed outline.\\n<extra_id_1>Assistant\\nAs a member of the Cafe24 partner cooperation team, I will share the schedule for an upcoming webinar that provides information on how to enter the global market using Market Plus. The webinar will be held on February 9th at 3 pm, and will be targeted at Enterprise (customer contact department) employees. The content of the webinar will be 100% utilization of the Cafe24 partner service, and will include an introduction to Market Plus, as well as introductions to global markets - Joom (entry into European market) / MSS (entry into Japanese market). A Q&A reception will be held before the webinar. Please check the webinar access link in the reminder notice next week.\\n After attending the seminar, I plan to use this content to create content for the in-house blog site to help Cafe24 employees understand how to enter the global market using Market Plus. Please write a detailed outline including the concepts to be emphasized.\\n<extra_id_1>User\\nRewrite, including concepts to be emphasized\", \"response\": \"As a member of the Cafe24 partner cooperation team, I am excited to share the schedule for an upcoming webinar that will provide valuable information on how to enter the global market using Market Plus. This webinar is scheduled for February 9th at 3 pm and is targeted at Enterprise (customer contact department) employees.\\n \\n\\n During the webinar, we will cover the 100% utilization of the Cafe24 partner service and introduce Market Plus, an innovative platform that enables businesses to enter the global market with ease. We will also provide introductions to two popular global markets - Joom (for entry into the European market) and MSS (for entry into the Japanese market).\\n \\n\\n To ensure that all participants have a clear understanding of the concepts discussed during the webinar, we will be holding a pre-Q&A reception. This will provide attendees with an opportunity to ask any questions they may have before the webinar begins.\\n \\n\\n Please note that the webinar access link will be provided in the reminder notice next week. I look forward to seeing you at the webinar and helping you understand how to enter the global market using Market Plus.\\n \\n\\n After the webinar, I will use the content covered during the session to create content for the in-house blog site. This content will focus on helping Cafe24 employees understand how to utilize Market Plus to enter the global market and achieve success.\\n \\n\\n In this blog post, we will emphasize the following concepts:\\n \\n\\n - The importance of global expansion for businesses looking to grow and succeed\\n - How Market Plus can help businesses enter the global market with ease\\n - The benefits of using Joom and MSS as entry points into the European and Japanese markets, respectively\\n - Best practices for successfully entering the global market\\n \\n\\n By focusing on these concepts, we hope to provide Cafe24 employees with a clear understanding of how to utilize Market Plus to achieve success in the global market.\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How long is `response` relative to what `prompt` asked for?\", \"criteria\": [\"Succinct: short, to the point, and the most concise it can be; no additional information beyond what was requested.\", \"Pretty short: on the shorter side, but could still have words, details or text removed before it is at the bare minimum.\", \"Average length: not especially long or short given what the prompt asks; adequate for a full response, neither wordy nor particularly concise.\", \"Moderately long: on the longer side, but could still have more added before it is fully detailed or rambling.\", \"Verbose: particularly lengthy, wordy and/or extensive with extra details given what the prompt requested, whether from repetition or from rich detail.\"]}", "label": "2", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_verbosity/test/25", "source": "helpsteer2_verbosity", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"Please provide the equation to calculate the moment of inertia of a trapezium\", \"response\": \"The moment of inertia of a trapezium can be calculated using the following equation:\\n\\nI = (1/12) * m * (a^2 + b^2) + (1/2) * m * (a + b) * h^2\\n\\nwhere:\\n\\nI = moment of inertia\\nm = mass of the trapezium\\na = length of the base of the trapezium\\nb = length of the other base of the trapezium\\nh = height of the trapezium\\nThis equation can be used to calculate the moment of inertia about the axis that is perpendicular to the bases of the trapezium and passes through the midpoint of the base.\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How long is `response` relative to what `prompt` asked for?\", \"criteria\": [\"Succinct: short, to the point, and the most concise it can be; no additional information beyond what was requested.\", \"Pretty short: on the shorter side, but could still have words, details or text removed before it is at the bare minimum.\", \"Average length: not especially long or short given what the prompt asks; adequate for a full response, neither wordy nor particularly concise.\", \"Moderately long: on the longer side, but could still have more added before it is fully detailed or rambling.\", \"Verbose: particularly lengthy, wordy and/or extensive with extra details given what the prompt requested, whether from repetition or from rich detail.\"]}", "label": "0", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_verbosity/test/736", "source": "helpsteer2_verbosity", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"explain chatgpt to first year college students\", \"response\": \"ChatGPT is a large language model that was developed by OpenAI and released in December 2022. It is designed to generate human-like text based on input provided by a user, and can be used for a variety of tasks such as answering questions, generating text, and completing tasks.\\n\\nHere's a simple explanation of how ChatGPT works:\\n\\nInput: The user provides input to ChatGPT in the form of text or questions. This input is used to generate a prompt that is fed into the model.\\n\\nPrediction: ChatGpt uses a deep learning algorithm called a transformer to predict the most likely next word or phrase based on the input prompt. The model is trained on a massive amount of text data, which allows it to understand the context and meaning of words and phrases.\\n\\nGeneration: Based on the predicted next word or phrase, ChatGPT generates a response that is meant to be human-like and relevant to the input prompt. This process is repeated until the entire response is generated.\\n\\nRefinement: During the generation process, ChatGPT can use feedback from the user to refine its response. For example, if the user provides feedback that the response is not accurate or relevant, the model can use this information to adjust its predictions and generate a better response.\\n\\nOverall, ChatGPT is designed to be a powerful tool for generating human-like text and can be used for a variety of tasks such as customer service, content generation, and language translation. It is important to note that while ChatGPT can be a useful tool, it is not perfect and can sometimes generate inaccurate or inappropriate responses.\\n\\nHere are some key things to keep in mind when using ChatGPT:\\n\\n1. Context: ChatGPT is designed to understand the context and meaning of words and phrases, but it is not perfect. It is important to provide clear and concise input prompts to ensure that the model understands the intended meaning and context of the task at hand.\\n\\n2. Feedback: During the generation process, it is important to provide feedback to ChatGPT to help refine its responses. This can include correcting errors, providing additional information, or providing feedback on the overall quality of the response.\\n\\n3. Creativity: While ChatGPT can generate human-like text, it is not creative in the same way that humans are. It is important to keep in mind that ChatGPT is designed to generate responses based on the input prompt and may not be able to generate unique or creative responses on its own.\\n\\n4. Limitations: ChatGPT is a powerful tool, but it is not perfect. It can sometimes generate inaccurate or inappropriate responses, especially if the input prompt is unclear or the task is complex. It is important to be aware of these limitations and to use ChatGPT with caution and appropriate supervision.\\n\\nOverall, ChatGPT can be a useful tool for generating human-like text and can be used for a variety of tasks such as customer service, content generation, and language translation. However, it is important to use it with caution and to be aware of its limitations and potential risks.\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How long is `response` relative to what `prompt` asked for?\", \"criteria\": [\"Succinct: short, to the point, and the most concise it can be; no additional information beyond what was requested.\", \"Pretty short: on the shorter side, b